  "full-article-text": "<p id=\"\">All that means is that that particular <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-are-smart-accounts\"><strong id=\"\">account</strong></a> was imported from an <a id=\"\" href=\"http://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-was-radixs-olympia-mainnet\"><strong id=\"\">Olympia Desktop Wallet</strong></a>. Olympia-created accounts use a different type of<a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-a-seed-phrase\"><strong id=\"\"> seed phrase </strong></a>than <a id=\"\" href=\"http://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-radixs-babylon-mainnet\"><strong id=\"\">Babylon</strong></a>-created accounts, and hence this is a Legacy Account.</p><p id=\"\">Other than that, there is no difference to these accounts and no action is required from you.</p>",
